# ── MARK LV — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# Local configuration and credentials
config/api_keys.json
config/mcp_servers.json
config/*secret*.json
config/*token*.json
config/certs/
config/whatsapp_web/
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
/.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/planner_state.json
memory/*.db
memory/*.db-*
memory/*.sqlite
memory/*.sqlite3
plugins/drafts/

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.spec
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
**/.venv/
venv/
**/venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/
# ── Backups & temporary snapshots ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.backup/
*.bak

# ── Frontend & Node dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
# ── Backups & temporary snapshots ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.backup/
*.bak
*.backup
*.tmp
cfg_*.tmp
jarvis_fw_*.bat